{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/A-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-59-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/B-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-41-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<p>Mr. Cheung and Mrs. Cheung said that since the redevelopment announcement, they have been gradually clearing stock, and seeing that progress was nearly complete, they decided a few months ago to close the business on July 31.</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/C-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-27-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/D-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-14-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/E-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-49-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/F-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-42-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<p>The shop floor is nearly 700 square feet, with several ceiling-high bookshelves. Mrs. Cheung said it is now very hard to find such a large space for a manga shop to store its books. \"It's not just the most popular manga—other ones that aren't hits but are good to read, we have them all too.\"</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/G-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-04-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/H-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-30-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/I-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-50-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/J-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-54-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<p>Mr. Cheung helped a customer seal a box and pushed a cart up to the delivery van, saying: \"I'm worried the young people aren't used to pushing the carts.\"</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/K-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-23-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/L-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-12-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/M-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-26-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/N-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-25-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/O-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-63-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/P-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-43-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Q-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-58-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/R-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-09-683x1024.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/S-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-61-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/T-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-66-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<p>Full text report: Choi Hung Estate Redevelopment | Comic World — Final Branch Closes, Faces Ups and Downs with a Smile, Clearance Sale to Show Gratitude: \"Everything will come to an end someday\"</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Payme-500x237.png\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-31T17:18:50.276819+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":204,"images":22,"source":"The Collective HK","fallback":"none"}}